    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Octagonal carved frame with pierced geometric roof panels, eight painted silk-look side panels, carved dragon-head corners and eight hanging red tassels. The top and bottom views confirm the roof lattice and base ring are properly closed. Only 7.8k tris for this much ornament.",
